00:00:04.879 --> 00:00:07.549 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>秘剑 飞饭纲！</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:13.096 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>该说是幸运还是不幸呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:17.142 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心的右臂承受了一些伤害
减轻了一些威力</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:17.225 --> 00:00:19.644 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的胳膊没有被完全切断</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:00:19.728 --> 00:00:24.065 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但这孩子再也不能练习剑术了</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:00:24.774 --> 00:00:26.151 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么会…</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:32.490 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>开什么玩笑…</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:00:32.574 --> 00:00:34.909 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他为了剑术赌上了一切！</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:00:34.993 --> 00:00:36.453 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还那么有天赋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:39.164 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么要承受这些？</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:00:39.247 --> 00:00:40.832 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不是大夫吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:00:40.915 --> 00:00:42.876 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>快做点什么啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:46.212 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>做不到的事就是做不到</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:50.800 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起 弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:52.135 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然很遗憾</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:54.846 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但医生也不是万能的</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:01:04.022 --> 00:01:08.610 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:02:37.198 --> 00:02:38.741 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:39.909 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>由太郎</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:02:40.785 --> 00:02:42.412 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的右臂动不了了</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:02:43.538 --> 00:02:45.456 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>果然这不是在做梦…</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:48.960 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父…</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:02:49.794 --> 00:02:50.920 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他背叛了我</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:02:55.341 --> 00:02:57.218 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村已经走了</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:03:00.388 --> 00:03:01.306 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们也去</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:03:02.682 --> 00:03:03.516 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:05.476 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他还不能乱动</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:07.562 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>需要静养</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:07.645 --> 00:03:08.521 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:08.605 --> 00:03:10.315 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们要去见证他们之间的了结</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:10.899 --> 00:03:12.775 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你现在不亲眼见证</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:12.859 --> 00:03:14.277 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是没法振作起来的</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:03:18.948 --> 00:03:21.200 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真拿他们没办法</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:03:21.784 --> 00:03:25.496 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好好看着他们 别让他们乱来</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:26.706 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:03:32.629 --> 00:03:33.630 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好慢</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:36.716 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一刻钟早就过去了</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:03:37.634 --> 00:03:41.554 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个男人一定是害怕吾辈的秘剑
所以逃跑了</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:03:42.138 --> 00:03:43.181 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:47.644 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这种对手他有什么必要逃跑？</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:03:47.727 --> 00:03:48.645 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（恶）</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:03:48.728 --> 00:03:49.812 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>或者说</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:03:49.896 --> 00:03:53.107 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也许你才是找借口想食言的那个</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:03:53.191 --> 00:03:55.235 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你想溜走的话 我不会阻止你</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:03:55.318 --> 00:03:57.570 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟对手是剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:03:59.113 --> 00:04:02.325 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有机会溜走就应该抓住机会啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:02.909 --> 00:04:05.578 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>说话注意点 小子</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:05.662 --> 00:04:09.332 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>吾辈不介意跟你玩玩打发时间</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:09.916 --> 00:04:12.168 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我倒是不介意</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:12.252 --> 00:04:13.503 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>可是</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:13.586 --> 00:04:15.421 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>输给剑客另当别论</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:04:16.005 --> 00:04:20.260 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你输给一个打手 那可就完了</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:04:31.145 --> 00:04:33.106 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来我们俩运气不好</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:04:33.189 --> 00:04:35.817 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要被打得哭哭啼啼地回家了</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:04:38.027 --> 00:04:40.363 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真正的战斗开始了</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:04:43.032 --> 00:04:45.535 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这次希望你认真和吾辈打一场</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:04:45.618 --> 00:04:50.707 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>吾辈要打败你
开创属于真古流的新时代</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:04:54.127 --> 00:05:01.050 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所谓“饭纲”的招式
实际上是劈开空气产生真空波</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:05:01.134 --> 00:05:03.928 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就是被称为“镰鼬”的自然现象</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:05:04.012 --> 00:05:06.347 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦 你注意到了</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:05:06.431 --> 00:05:09.767 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>伤口很宽 但是出血却很少</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:05:09.851 --> 00:05:12.729 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是镰鼬造成的伤口的典型特征</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:12.812 --> 00:05:16.691 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算你看穿饭纲的本质
也改变不了它的强大</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:05:18.276 --> 00:05:21.321 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下一瞬间能看到
你劈过的地方发生变形</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:05:21.404 --> 00:05:23.656 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>和夏天的灼热雾气一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:27.535 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>都是由瞬间产生的空气浓度差造成的</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:05:29.954 --> 00:05:31.748 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是破解你招式的线索</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:05:32.457 --> 00:05:35.626 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>之前是在下大意才没发现</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:05:35.710 --> 00:05:39.422 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么至少 在下现在要打败饭纲</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:05:39.505 --> 00:05:40.798 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>可笑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:05:41.966 --> 00:05:44.594 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只有三流剑客
才会被曾见识过一次的剑招</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:05:44.677 --> 00:05:46.345 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>再次打到</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:05:46.429 --> 00:05:49.682 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心怎么可能被打到？</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:05:50.266 --> 00:05:55.688 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>秘剑飞饭纲虽然十分锐利 无法阻挡</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:05:55.772 --> 00:05:59.233 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但对于能读出弹道
并躲开子弹的超一流剑客来说</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:05:59.317 --> 00:06:01.527 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>躲开这招并非不可能</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:06:02.153 --> 00:06:04.030 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就尝尝这招！</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:06:05.823 --> 00:06:07.241 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>连发的飞饭纲？</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:06:20.630 --> 00:06:23.549 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看到了吧？这就是饭纲！</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:06:23.633 --> 00:06:25.426 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吾辈从古流剑术秘籍上看到</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:29.013 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>又花了十年岁月领悟的秘剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:06:29.097 --> 00:06:31.849 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哪里那么容易破解？</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:06:31.933 --> 00:06:34.560 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是真古流的象征</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:06:34.644 --> 00:06:37.897 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>终极杀人剑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:06:38.439 --> 00:06:39.524 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你很开心吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:06:41.818 --> 00:06:42.652 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:06:43.486 --> 00:06:47.990 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这点小擦伤就让你这么开心？</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:06:48.866 --> 00:06:51.077 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:06:51.661 --> 00:06:54.747 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在在下确定了 雷十太</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:06:54.831 --> 00:06:56.457 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>确定了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:06:56.541 --> 00:06:57.542 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>确定什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:06:58.334 --> 00:07:04.757 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你一直宣扬杀人剑 却从没杀过人</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:10.138 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>杀过人的真正的刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:07:10.221 --> 00:07:14.142 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不会在打倒对手前
就对自己的剑招如此洋洋得意</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:07:15.309 --> 00:07:20.940 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你根本不知道手持刽子手之剑的人
陷入了多深的地狱</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:21.023 --> 00:07:27.738 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而你那浅薄又傲慢的剑
夺走了由太郎修习剑术的机会</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:07:30.158 --> 00:07:32.869 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>做好付出相应代价的觉悟吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:07:35.496 --> 00:07:38.249 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>吾辈不会再容忍你的任何嘲弄</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:38.332 --> 00:07:39.500 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>去死吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:44.964 --> 00:07:47.884 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:47.967 --> 00:07:51.345 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>用缠饭纲和飞饭纲进行联合攻击</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:07:52.388 --> 00:07:56.476 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心在攻击范围内时用缠饭纲
不给剑心攻击的间隙</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:07:56.559 --> 00:07:59.937 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当剑心在范围外时
就使用飞饭纲来造成致命伤</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:08:00.021 --> 00:08:02.732 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为没法回击或阻挡饭纲</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:08:02.815 --> 00:08:05.026 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心只能不断闪躲</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:08:05.109 --> 00:08:07.528 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且他的右臂负伤了</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:08:07.612 --> 00:08:11.824 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只用左手 剑心的龙槌闪威力会减半</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:08:11.908 --> 00:08:14.660 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也不能使用他最擅长的拔刀术</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:08:14.744 --> 00:08:17.788 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样一直处于被动可不妙</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:08:17.872 --> 00:08:18.998 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看穿了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:08:19.081 --> 00:08:20.374 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就是那里！</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:08:20.875 --> 00:08:22.001 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:08:23.044 --> 00:08:25.046 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>吾辈赢了</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:08:25.129 --> 00:08:29.842 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管你速度多快
腿受伤了可没法自由行动</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:30.468 --> 00:08:31.844 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>都说了一点小擦伤而已</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:31.928 --> 00:08:33.971 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别每次都这么开心啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:34.055 --> 00:08:35.389 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>可笑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:08:35.473 --> 00:08:39.852 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你尽可能说大话吧
但这种距离你是没法反击的</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:39.936 --> 00:08:44.565 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>除非你像吾辈一样能用出飞饭纲</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:08:44.649 --> 00:08:46.734 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>飞饭纲…</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:08:46.817 --> 00:08:48.402 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下用不出来</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:08:48.486 --> 00:08:50.238 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:08:50.321 --> 00:08:52.532 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真古流才是至高</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:08:52.615 --> 00:08:55.493 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>饭纲才是最强</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:08:55.576 --> 00:08:56.452 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>去死吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:08:56.536 --> 00:09:00.414 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过在攻击范围外攻击
在下也做得到！</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:09:06.754 --> 00:09:08.965 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>飞天御剑流拔刀术！</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:09:09.549 --> 00:09:10.508 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>飞龙闪！</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:09:52.425 --> 00:09:53.301 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:10:01.392 --> 00:10:02.393 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别乱动</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:10:03.019 --> 00:10:05.271 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>敢乱动 吾辈就杀了这个小子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:10:07.732 --> 00:10:10.610 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>吾辈说要杀了他</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:10:10.693 --> 00:10:13.112 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>放下你的刀！</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:10:13.195 --> 00:10:14.614 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你杀啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:10:15.197 --> 00:10:17.325 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你能下得了手就杀</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:10:17.408 --> 00:10:21.078 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我就算是死 也不会向你屈服的</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:10:22.622 --> 00:10:25.207 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他自己都这么说了</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:10:25.291 --> 00:10:26.667 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你动手啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:10:27.376 --> 00:10:29.962 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真古流不是杀人剑吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:10:33.007 --> 00:10:35.384 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么“用真剑” 什么“古流”</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:10:35.468 --> 00:10:38.763 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这些都不一定是杀人剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:10:39.347 --> 00:10:43.726 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>因夺走他人生命
而沉重到让自己坠入地狱深渊的</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:10:43.809 --> 00:10:45.478 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>才是杀人剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:10:46.646 --> 00:10:49.940 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你没杀过人</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:10:50.024 --> 00:10:55.071 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的真古流可以斩人 但却没法杀人</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:10:56.155 --> 00:11:02.328 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>放下剑吧
在碰上真正的杀人剑被夺去性命前</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:11:30.189 --> 00:11:31.023 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>走吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:11:33.984 --> 00:11:35.111 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们走</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:11:46.789 --> 00:11:47.957 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>永别了</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:11:48.582 --> 00:11:49.583 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:12:05.391 --> 00:12:09.728 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>辛苦你们特意过来
但少爷说他不想见任何人</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:12:10.354 --> 00:12:12.064 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:12:12.148 --> 00:12:13.816 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对了 这是慰问品</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:12:13.899 --> 00:12:15.317 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>多谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:12:16.068 --> 00:12:18.654 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>过一段时间我们会再来的</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:12:19.238 --> 00:12:20.948 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>非常感谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:12:22.116 --> 00:12:24.368 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>请一定再来</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:12:26.745 --> 00:12:28.956 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他把自己关起来也情有可原</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:12:29.039 --> 00:12:35.754 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟他被自己视为理想的师父背叛了
而且不能再练习剑术了</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:12:36.338 --> 00:12:39.175 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然神谷活心流是救人剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:12:39.258 --> 00:12:41.719 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但这次该怎么办才好？</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:12:41.802 --> 00:12:43.345 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>太无力了</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:12:43.429 --> 00:12:45.723 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想不到任何一句能安慰他的话</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:13:08.412 --> 00:13:10.206 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>回想过去</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:13:10.789 --> 00:13:13.876 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>明治维新之后 生活发生了剧变</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:13:13.959 --> 00:13:17.379 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我一个没有任何门路的下层武士</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:13:17.463 --> 00:13:22.343 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只凭着会挑刀剑的好眼光
成了刀剑商人</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:13:22.426 --> 00:13:28.807 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且在外国大获成功
赚取了如此多的财富</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:13:29.391 --> 00:13:36.357 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在许多士族没落的时代
我的人生乍一看很成功吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:13:36.899 --> 00:13:41.278 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是换一个角度看
也可以说是败犬的一生</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:13:41.362 --> 00:13:45.950 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了养活、保护家人</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:13:46.033 --> 00:13:52.873 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>向过去所说的夷狄谄媚讨好
卖出作为武士之魂的刀剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:13:53.541 --> 00:13:59.463 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以由太郎才不想像我这样活着吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:14:00.214 --> 00:14:02.091 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>然而</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:14:03.384 --> 00:14:09.056 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我却被石动雷十太的表面实力骗了</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:14:12.142 --> 00:14:13.310 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在这啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:14:13.811 --> 00:14:15.688 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>来得好快啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:14:16.355 --> 00:14:17.815 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>由左卫门先生</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:14:17.898 --> 00:14:22.820 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>今天我们就聊到这里
在下告辞 改日再来探望</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:14:23.404 --> 00:14:25.406 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>多谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:14:25.489 --> 00:14:28.659 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过下次可能是你最后一次见到我了</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:14:29.743 --> 00:14:32.037 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我考虑了很多</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:14:32.121 --> 00:14:37.501 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>决定把由太郎带去德国</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:14:37.585 --> 00:14:38.836 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-德国？
-德国？</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:14:40.004 --> 00:14:44.425 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>德国是现在世界上医学最先进的国家</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:14:44.508 --> 00:14:49.513 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在德国接受治疗或许可以治好他</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:14:49.597 --> 00:14:56.145 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且如果住在国外
由太郎应该也能忘掉剑术吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:14:57.521 --> 00:14:59.940 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们一周后出发</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:15:00.024 --> 00:15:02.985 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么时候回国就不知道了</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:15:07.489 --> 00:15:10.826 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（新桥站）</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:15:14.121 --> 00:15:17.291 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的很感谢你们的关照</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:15:17.374 --> 00:15:19.043 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>由太郎</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:15:19.126 --> 00:15:21.253 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>做个最后的告别吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:15:24.506 --> 00:15:25.716 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>由太郎…</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:15:27.009 --> 00:15:30.679 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我果然还是说不出任何安慰的话来</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:15:31.263 --> 00:15:36.143 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算鼓励他让他加油
也没法减轻他的痛苦</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:15:39.688 --> 00:15:42.691 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>老爷 出发时间快到了</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:15:42.775 --> 00:15:44.151 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我知道了</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:15:44.902 --> 00:15:46.028 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就告辞了</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:16:00.417 --> 00:16:01.502 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>由太郎！</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:16:07.174 --> 00:16:08.425 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦？</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:16:08.509 --> 00:16:12.429 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你准备这样一直消沉下去吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:16:13.973 --> 00:16:17.309 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果雷十太的背叛让你那么痛苦</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:16:17.393 --> 00:16:21.271 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就变得比雷十太更强大
来消除痛苦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:16:21.355 --> 00:16:25.609 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是那个被剑心打倒的雷十太</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:16:25.693 --> 00:16:30.280 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而是那个你理想中的雷十太！</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:16:30.364 --> 00:16:34.284 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你做不到
那你一辈子都只是一条败犬！</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:16:36.078 --> 00:16:37.246 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:16:39.832 --> 00:16:42.084 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>闭上嘴听我说</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:16:42.167 --> 00:16:44.294 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说谁是败犬？</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:16:44.378 --> 00:16:45.462 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>由太郎</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:16:45.546 --> 00:16:47.548 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我绝对不会放弃剑术！</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:16:48.298 --> 00:16:49.758 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>绝对不会！</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:16:49.842 --> 00:16:53.637 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>右手不行 那我就用左手</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:16:53.721 --> 00:16:57.725 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只用我的左手就足够打败你了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:16:57.808 --> 00:17:01.603 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>少说大话 你个猫眼懦夫！</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:17:01.687 --> 00:17:04.314 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>闭嘴 你个乖僻的臭小子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:17:07.276 --> 00:17:08.527 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊…</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:17:09.236 --> 00:17:10.529 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:17:11.572 --> 00:17:12.656 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:17:16.243 --> 00:17:18.287 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不用担心了</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:17:22.166 --> 00:17:24.251 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>听着 可别忘了</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:17:24.334 --> 00:17:27.046 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们的胜负还没了结</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:17:27.129 --> 00:17:29.131 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一定要回来啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:17:29.214 --> 00:17:33.802 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>神谷活心流第二弟子的位子
我会给你留着 等你回来</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:17:46.690 --> 00:17:48.609 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是一群善良的人啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:17:49.276 --> 00:17:50.402 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那家伙</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:17:50.486 --> 00:17:54.490 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对受伤的人也不手下留情</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:17:58.202 --> 00:17:59.495 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>明神弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:18:00.287 --> 00:18:02.539 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会回来打倒你</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:18:04.917 --> 00:18:08.253 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好了 好不容易来一次新桥</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:18:08.337 --> 00:18:09.880 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们去吃点西餐吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:18:09.963 --> 00:18:12.091 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>又准备让我请客吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:18:13.717 --> 00:18:16.845 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心 你的表情怎么这么严肃？</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:18:17.763 --> 00:18:18.597 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:18:19.264 --> 00:18:22.059 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下只是在想石动雷十太的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:18:22.684 --> 00:18:24.603 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是个讨厌的家伙</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:18:24.686 --> 00:18:28.941 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但缠饭纲和飞饭纲这两招确实很厉害</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:18:29.483 --> 00:18:31.318 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的确有剑术方面的天赋</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:18:31.985 --> 00:18:34.696 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过也因为这天赋</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:40.035 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他没有寻求剑术的本质
一味追求剑术技巧</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:18:41.161 --> 00:18:44.498 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果不是那么执着于真古流和杀人剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:18:44.581 --> 00:18:48.919 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在明治时代
也许他真的可以开创新的剑术</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:18:50.295 --> 00:18:51.880 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>希望有一天他会明白</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:18:52.464 --> 00:18:58.178 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没有越过杀人这一底线是多么的幸运</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:19:00.722 --> 00:19:03.183 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 你们在干嘛呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:19:03.267 --> 00:19:04.268 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>快走吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:19:06.728 --> 00:19:12.359 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>以前在下跟中越流的前川师父
探讨过剑术的未来</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:19:13.068 --> 00:19:15.821 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当时他很悲观</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:19:17.072 --> 00:19:23.287 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是看到弥彦和由太郎他们
似乎不用担心啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:19:30.752 --> 00:19:31.670 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:19:31.753 --> 00:19:32.629 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（神谷薰）</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:19:32.713 --> 00:19:33.839 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（门生 明神弥彦
预定 塚山由太郎）</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:21:15.649 --> 00:21:17.276 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>杀人…</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:21:17.359 --> 00:21:18.694 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管是谁</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:21:18.777 --> 00:21:19.695 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要杀人</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:30.831 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么“用真剑” 什么“古流”</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:21:30.914 --> 00:21:34.167 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这些都不一定是杀人剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:21:34.876 --> 00:21:39.214 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>因夺走他人生命
而沉重到让自己坠入地狱深渊的</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:21:40.173 --> 00:21:41.925 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>才是杀人剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:22:02.863 --> 00:22:04.865 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 这是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:22:46.615 --> 00:22:49.451 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一集 《左之助与锦绘》</c.simplifiedchinese>

